OL,6,CG1979FChristopher Morris - BBC home
OL,7,Fnews reporter - is the duty news
OL,8,Fpresenter on Bank Holiday Monday.
OL,9,
OL,10,FHe announces the assassination of Earl
OL,11,FMountbatten of Burma by the IRA in the
OL,12,Ffirst of seven newsflashes within
OL,13,FGrandstand.
OL,14,
OL,15,FThe main evening news bulletin is
OL,16,Fextended from 8 to 45 minutes.
OL,17,
OL,18,CG1981FMoira Stuart presents a BBC TV
OL,19,Fnews programme for the first time. She
OL,20,Fjoined BBC TV News as their first
OL,21,FAfrican-Caribbean newsreader.
